#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Mart/scripts.inc:38
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Mart_Text_ItemsToTemporarilyElevateStats"
msgid ""
"There are items that temporarily\n"
"elevate the stats of POKéMON.\p"
"The ones I know you use in battle\n"
"are X ATTACK and X DEFEND…\p"
"I do believe that there are others\n"
"like them.$"
msgstr ""
"有些道具能暂时\n"
"提高宝可梦的能力。\p"
"我知道在对战中使用的\n"
"有力量强化和防御强化……\p"
"我相信应该还有\n"
"其他类似的道具。$"

#: data/maps/MauvilleCity_Mart/scripts.inc:46
msgctxt "MauvilleCity_Mart_Text_DecisionsDetermineBattle"
msgid ""
"Use a certain move, or use an item\n"
"instead…\p"
"The TRAINER's decisions determine how\n"
"battles turn out, I think.$"
msgstr ""
"是使用某个招式，\n"
"还是改用道具……\p"
"我觉得训练家的决定\n"
"会左右对战的结果。$"
